# The Worker's configuration in the e2e tests (`wrangler dev --env-file`, so the real `.env` is never read): a dummy
# OAuth App, so the tests never depend on, or use, the real one. The token exchange is answered in the browser
# (`src/github/GitHubMock.ts`), so the Worker never sends these to GitHub.
GITHQ_ENV=e2e
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=e2e-secret
